  "notes": "Fixed supply conflict for berm haul: added borrow excavation T10 (13 m3) in Z3 to cover shortfall beyond foundation spoil (32 m3). Split original haul T8 into T8a (32 m3 from foundation) and T8b (13 m3 from borrow), each with after-edges from its dig source. Added missing compact foundation task T6 (64 m2). Added berm inspection T11 per sign-off practice. Assumed berm base width 3 m (1:1 slope, height 1.5 m) for volume and footprint. All tasks respect single-robot-per-zone constraint and robot batteries. Excavator tasks sequenced T1->T5->T10 due to single EX1. Hauler tasks T8a, T8b sequential on HL1. Compactors CP1/CP2 can parallelize across zones but zone limit sequences within each zone. Surveyor inspections sequential T4->T7->T11."
